reported hull damage and signal that he required no outside help. He plans to

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:12.240
use three spinnaker poles as a jury rig and make northward progress when

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:16.620
conditions allow, aiming first for latitudes near 30 degrees south where winds may

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:21.460
become more favorable. Two root options are under consideration, at least 1,000

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:26.000
Nautical Miles Northeast, followed by roughly 1,500 Nautical Miles toward the African

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:31.500
Coast, or a direct passage of about 3,500 Nautical Miles to Perth in Western Australia.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:35.660
