00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:10.000
The first Golden Globe in 1968 saw nine starters and only one finisher, Sir Robin Knox-Johnston.

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:14.880
A dismissing at this stage in a retro-class solo round the world race ends any realistic

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:19.600
a chance of finishing under the event's strict no-modern technology rules, and forces a long,

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:25.100
slow passage under jury rig with limited ability to make progress upwind. The ocean race announced

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:29.780
a long-term partnership that moves its operational headquarters and Atlantic-based Deporto Portugal

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:36.080
from 2028 through 2040. The agreement was launched at the Porto Historical Customs Building and

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:42.760
involves Turismo Deportugal, Turismo Deporto-enorted Deportugal, and Porto City Council. He elements

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:46.740
Includes a new operational headquarters in a historic waterfront building near Park

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:52.180
a desidade, a festival of sailing in 2028, starts for three editions of the round the

00:02:52.180 --> 00:02:58.500
world race from Porto in 2030, 2034 and 2038, at least six additional international

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:03.880
