00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:38.340
2028. With 50 days until the start, the team is preparing for a very different kind of race.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:42.860
Scott and Alan previously set a new double-handed course record in 2023.

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:48.680
This time, they will race Amira 4, a foiling IMOCA capable of significantly higher speeds

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:49.780
