00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:44.880
Amira 4 is currently in Gossport, UK, undergoing adjustments and repairs ahead of the crossing.

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:49.420
The team will deliver her to Lanza Rote in December for final preparations before the

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:49.620
